---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import "../styles/about.css";
---

<Base title="About Me">
  <div class="about-wrapper">

    <!-- Whoami -->
    <div class="whoami-section">
      <h1 class="ibm-plex-serif-regular">Whoami</h1>
      <div class="bio-card">
        <p class="ibm-plex-serif-regular">
          I am a third-year Computer Engineering student who loves everything related to computers.
          I've been learning programming and cyber security for about 7-8 years.
        </p>
        <p class="ibm-plex-serif-regular">
          More specifically, I am passionate about Cyber Security.
          I thoroughly enjoy Binary Exploitation, Exploit Development, and Reverse Engineering.
        </p>
        <p class="ibm-plex-serif-regular">
          I also actively participate in CTFs with my team <a href="https://resetsec.github.io">ResetSec</a>.
          My favorite categories are pwn and Reverse Engineering.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Timeline -->
    <div class="timeline-section">
      <h1 class="ibm-plex-serif-regular">My Journey</h1>
      <div class="timeline-container">
        <div class="timeline-line"></div>
        <div class="timeline">
          <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-circle"></div>
            <div class="timeline-textbox">
              <p><h1 class="title ibm-plex-serif-regular">General Introduction to Programming</h1></p>
              <p class="duration"><small class="ibm-plex-serif-regular">2016 - 2017</small></p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-circle"></div>
            <div class="timeline-textbox">
              <p><h1 class="title ibm-plex-serif-regular">3D Modelling with Blender & Video Editing</h1></p>
              <p class="duration"><small class="ibm-plex-serif-regular">2017 - 2018</small></p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-circle"></div>
            <div class="timeline-textbox">
              <p><h1 class="title ibm-plex-serif-regular">Basics of Cyber Security</h1></p>
              <p class="duration"><small class="ibm-plex-serif-regular">2017 - 2019</small></p>
              <p class="content ibm-plex-serif-regular">During this time I started with general introduction to cybersecurity and learnt fundament concepts like networking, social engineering, common web attacks, etc.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-circle"></div>
            <div class="timeline-textbox">
              <p><h1 class="title ibm-plex-serif-regular">Switched to full-time Linux</h1></p>
              <p class="duration"><small class="ibm-plex-serif-regular">2017 - present</small></p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-circle"></div>
            <div class="timeline-textbox">
              <p><h1 class="title ibm-plex-serif-regular">Low level development & Advanced security topics</h1></p>
              <p class="duration"><small class="ibm-plex-serif-regular">2019 - 2021</small></p>
              <p class="content ibm-plex-serif-regular">During this time I started developing genuine interest towards cyber security. I learnt the basics of computer architecture, assembly language, shellcoding and got introduced to memory corruption exploits like buffer overflows.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-circle"></div>
            <div class="timeline-textbox">
              <p><h1 class="title ibm-plex-serif-regular">Web Development</h1></p>
              <p class="duration"><small class="ibm-plex-serif-regular">2021 - 2023</small></p>
              <p class="content ibm-plex-serif-regular">During this time I was preparing for JEE, hence couldn't dedicate much time to hacking. Because I had a decent understanding of web security, I start with web development. I learnt front-end with HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React, Electron and backend with PHP, NodeJS, and MySQL.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-circle"></div>
            <div class="timeline-textbox">
              <p><h1 class="title ibm-plex-serif-regular">CTFs & Expanding my knowledge about binary exploitation</h1></p>
              <p class="duration"><small class="ibm-plex-serif-regular">2023 - present</small></p>
              <p class="content ibm-plex-serif-regular">During this time I found an excellent team with which I could participate in various international CTF events. This is when I got exposed to genuine challenges in cyber security. Previously I had very rudimentary understanding of low level topics but from here I started to really delve into the intricacies of memory corruption attacks.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Skills -->
    <div class="skill-container">
      <h1 class="ibm-plex-serif-regular">Skills</h1>
      <ul class="skill-list">
        <li class="skill-list-item"><img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/-Assembly-blue?style=for-the-badge&logoColor=white" loading="lazy" alt="Assembly" /></li>
        <li class="skill-list-item"><img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/-Bash-4EAA25?style=for-the-badge&logo=gnubash&logoColor=white" loading="lazy" alt="Bash" /></li>
        <li class="skill-list-item"><img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/-C-A8B9CC?style=for-the-badge&logo=C&logoColor=white" loading="lazy" alt="C" /></li>
        <li class="skill-list-item"><img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/-C%2B%2B-00599C?style=for-the-badge&logo=cplusplus&logoColor=white" loading="lazy" alt="C++" /></li>
        <li class="skill-list-item"><img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/-Java-blue?style=for-the-badge&logo=Java&logoColor=white" loading="lazy" alt="Java" /></li>
        <li class="skill-list-item"><img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/-JavaScript-F7DF1E?style=for-the-badge&logo=JavaScript&logoColor=black" loading="lazy" alt="JavaScript" /></li>
        <li class="skill-list-item"><img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/-PHP-777BB4?style=for-the-badge&logo=PHP&logoColor=white" loading="lazy" alt="PHP" /></li>
        <li class="skill-list-item"><img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/-Python-3776AB?style=for-the-badge&logo=Python&logoColor=white" loading="lazy" alt="Python" /></li>
        <li class="skill-list-item"><img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/-Ruby-CC342D?style=for-the-badge&logo=Ruby&logoColor=white" loading="lazy" alt="Ruby" /></li>
        <li class="skill-list-item"><img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/-Rust-000000?style=for-the-badge&logo=Rust&logoColor=white" loading="lazy" alt="Rust" /></li>
        <li class="skill-list-item"><img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/-SQL-blue?style=for-the-badge&logo=SQL&logoColor=white" loading="lazy" alt="SQL" /></li>
        <li class="skill-list-item"><img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/-HTML-E34F26?style=for-the-badge&logo=HTML&logoColor=white" loading="lazy" alt="HTML" /></li>
        <li class="skill-list-item"><img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/-CSS-1572B6?style=for-the-badge&logo=CSS&logoColor=white" loading="lazy" alt="CSS" /></li>
        <li class="skill-list-item"><img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/-NodeJS-339933?style=for-the-badge&logo=nodedotjs&logoColor=white" loading="lazy" alt="NodeJS" /></li>
        <li class="skill-list-item"><img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/-Linux-FCC624?style=for-the-badge&logo=Linux&logoColor=black" loading="lazy" alt="Linux" /></li>
        <li class="skill-list-item"><img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/-Arch_Linux-1793D1?style=for-the-badge&logo=archlinux&logoColor=white" loading="lazy" alt="Arch Linux" /></li>
        <li class="skill-list-item"><img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/-Terminal-F46D01?style=for-the-badge&logo=alacritty&logoColor=white" loading="lazy" alt="Terminal" /></li>
        <li class="skill-list-item"><img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/-vim-019733?style=for-the-badge&logo=vim" loading="lazy" alt="vim" /></li>
        <li class="skill-list-item"><img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/-BurpSuite-FF6633?style=for-the-badge&logo=burpsuite&logoColor=white" loading="lazy" alt="BurpSuite" /></li>
        <li class="skill-list-item"><img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/-Metasploit-2596CD?style=for-the-badge&logo=metasploit&logoColor=white" loading="lazy" alt="Metasploit" /></li>
        <li class="skill-list-item"><img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/-Binary_Exploitation-black?style=for-the-badge" loading="lazy" alt="Binary Exploitation" /></li>
        <li class="skill-list-item"><img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/-Reverse_Engineering-black?style=for-the-badge" loading="lazy" alt="Reverse Engineering" /></li>
        <li class="skill-list-item"><img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/-GDB-black?style=for-the-badge" loading="lazy" alt="GDB" /></li>
        <li class="skill-list-item"><img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/-Video_Editing-black?style=for-the-badge" loading="lazy" alt="Video Editing" /></li>
        <li class="skill-list-item"><img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/-Blender-E87D0D?style=for-the-badge&logo=blender&logoColor=white" loading="lazy" alt="Blender" /></li>
        <li class="skill-list-item"><img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/-Unity-FFFFFF?style=for-the-badge&logo=unity&logoColor=black" loading="lazy" alt="Unity" /></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Connect -->
    <div class="connect-section">
      <h1 class="ibm-plex-serif-regular">Connect</h1>
      <div class="connect-grid">
        <a href="https://pwn.college/hacker/43275" class="connect-card">
          <i class="fas fa-graduation-cap"></i>
          <span class="ibm-plex-serif-regular">pwn.college</span>
        </a>
        <a href="https://app.hackthebox.com/users/1821256" class="connect-card">
          <i class="fas fa-cube"></i>
          <span class="ibm-plex-serif-regular">HackTheBox</span>
        </a>
        <a href="https://tryhackme.com/p/VulnX" class="connect-card">
          <i class="fas fa-terminal"></i>
          <span class="ibm-plex-serif-regular">TryHackMe</span>
        </a>
        <a href="https://github.com/VulnX" class="connect-card">
          <i class="fab fa-github"></i>
          <span class="ibm-plex-serif-regular">GitHub</span>
        </a>
        <a href="https://ctftime.org/user/171307" class="connect-card">
          <i class="fas fa-flag"></i>
          <span class="ibm-plex-serif-regular">CTFTime</span>
        </a>
        <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@thevulnx" class="connect-card">
          <i class="fab fa-youtube"></i>
          <span class="ibm-plex-serif-regular">YouTube</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <script>
    const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
      entries.forEach((entry) => {
        if (entry.isIntersecting) {
          entry.target.classList.add("show-timeline-item");
        }
      });
    });
    const timelineItems = document.getElementsByClassName("timeline-item");
    for (let item of timelineItems) {
      observer.observe(item);
    }
  </script>
</Base>

<style>
  .ibm-plex-serif-regular { font-family: "IBM Plex Serif", serif; }
</style>
